  "description": "IXONOZ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C50 H50 Dy4 N14 O20,4(C1 H4 O1),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.761-4.023 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.70-119.22°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C54H66N14O26Dy4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 6 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
